QA6 C2. The later writer of the wrapper's field stores errors.Join(check(a),
check(b)), which is nil when both checks pass: the wrapper with a nil field
is listed as a value of its own, which the guard on what the literal stored
does not remove. (Run time: T(1, 2) is a *W whose inner is nil.)
